{"id":"7cadc4ab36b41124","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-thm-con-zfc.md","title":"Con(ZFC)","display":"thm-con-zfc — Con(ZFC)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-con-zfc","aliases":["58-thm-con-zfc"],"display":"thm-con-zfc — Con(ZFC)","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-consistency]]","[[../batch09/58-df-model]]","[[../batch08/58-df-theory]]","[[../batch09/58-lem-soundness]]","[[../batch09/58-lem-completeness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-con-zfc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-con-zfc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-con-zfc — Con(ZFC)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6996aaff4caeacce\" href=\"?note=6996aaff4caeacce\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-consistency\">../batch13/58-df-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-model\">../batch09/58-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory\">../batch08/58-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0f061d99a59e6f71\" href=\"?note=0f061d99a59e6f71\" title=\"../batch09/58-lem-soundness\">../batch09/58-lem-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3b37b21cb6146254\" href=\"?note=3b37b21cb6146254\" title=\"../batch09/58-lem-completeness\">../batch09/58-lem-completeness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span> (the first-order language of set theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\">\\(\\operatorname{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\)</span> (the first-order theory of ZFC)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}\\)</span> (theory predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_S\\)</span> (syntactic-consistency predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}_S\\)</span> (model predicate from dependency)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}con\\text{-}zfc}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Theory}(\\operatorname{ZFC},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Con}_S(\\operatorname{ZFC})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal M\\;\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,\\operatorname{ZFC},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}con\\text{-}zfc}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Theory}(\\operatorname{ZFC},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Con}_S(\\operatorname{ZFC})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal M\\;\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,\\operatorname{ZFC},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The theory predicate now carries its required language argument. By the cited soundness and completeness lemmas, syntactic consistency of the well-formed first-order theory is equivalent to existence of a model; that model need not be transitive or well-founded.</li>\n<li>The existence of a transitive model of ZFC implies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_S(\\operatorname{ZFC})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_S(\\operatorname{ZFC})\\)</span> but is strictly stronger than the displayed consistency statement.</li>\n<li>Gödel's second incompleteness theorem says that, if ZFC is consistent, ZFC does not prove its own consistency.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"6996aaff4caeacce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-lem-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0f061d99a59e6f71","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-lem-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-lem-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"3b37b21cb6146254","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-lem-completeness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ZFC}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Model}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}con\\text{-}zfc}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Theory}(\\operatorname{ZFC},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Con}_S(\\operatorname{ZFC})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal M\\;\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,\\operatorname{ZFC},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_S(\\operatorname{ZFC})","display":false}],"bytes":1554,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4095","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-thm-con-zfc.md|58-thm-con-zfc]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["6996aaff4caeacce","923884eb8fe4e61d","90ce6acf0c65af45","0f061d99a59e6f71","3b37b21cb6146254"]}